# HARD.P0-9 — H6: replace `bc` in the CI coverage gate

.github/workflows/ci.yml:46 used `echo "$TOTAL < 70" | bc -l`. GitHub-hosted
ubuntu-latest runners do not ship bc, so the step (and the whole go job)
always failed. Replaced with the awk form from hardening-doc.md.

## awk gate logic, both branches (local)

$ TOTAL=72.3
Coverage 72.3% is at or above the 70% threshold
exit=0

$ TOTAL=65.1
Coverage 65.1% is below 70% threshold
exit 1 (step fails as designed)

## Real coverage run on this repo through the new gate

$ go test -coverprofile=/tmp/coverage.out ./internal/...
$ TOTAL=$(go tool cover -func=/tmp/coverage.out | tail -1 | awk '{print $3}' | tr -d '%')
Total coverage: 76.1%
Coverage 76.1% is at or above the 70% threshold (gate PASSES on this repo)

## YAML validity

workflow parses; no `bc` reference remains anywhere in .github/workflows/.
